  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n? = 5 × 3 ÷ 3 of 6 - 8 ÷ 2 × (3 - 5) + 3 - 2 × 4 ÷ 6 of (1)/(2)\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/74be7d684e79cb4558507cda8a81f8d9ae628e9c651b637c3213995dbee35e6b.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n⇒ ? = 5 × 3 ÷ 3 of 6 - 8 ÷ 2 × (3 - 5) + 3 - 2 × 4 ÷ 6 of (1)/(2)\n\n⇒ ? = 5 × 3 ÷ 18 - 8 ÷ 2 × (-2) + 3 - 2 × 4 ÷ 3\n\n⇒ ? = 5 × (1)/(6) - 4 × (-2) + 3 - 2 × (4)/(3)\n\n⇒ ? = (5)/(6) + 8 + 3 - (8)/(3)\n\n⇒ ? = (5 + 48 + 18 - 16)/(6)\n\n**Therefore, '(55)/(6)' is the required answer.**",
